script\n# MyDatabase.gd\nextends Resource\nconst MyData : Script = preload(\"res://my_data.gd\")\n@export var dict : Dictionary[StringName, MyData]\n```\nIf `MyData` is defined like this:\n```gdscript\n#my_data.gd\n#class_name MyData\nextends Resource\n@export var a : int\n```\nIf you uncomment `class_name MyData` the behaviour is as expected.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nWIP","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109574/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109574/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}